{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12807","headline":"送崔秀才赴上元兼省叔父 · 韩翃","name":"送崔秀才赴上元兼省叔父","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒塘敛暮雪，腊鼓迎春早。\n匹马五城人，重裘千里道。\n淮山轻露湿，江树狂风扫。\n楚县久酝醲，扬州百花好。\n练湖东望接云阳，女市西游入建康。\n行乐远夸红布旆，风流近赌紫香囊。\n诗家行辈如君少，极目苦心怀谢朓。\n烟开日上板桥南，吴岫青青出林表。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}